d 'GSHEET': Import a public Google Sheet directly to Stata via Python Integration
d
d Use the Python Integration available in Stata 16+
d to import a public Google Sheet by URL. Requires a 
d functioning Python environment correctly setup for
d integration with the pandas and numpy packages.
d 
d Requires: Stata 16+ with functioning Python Integration, pandas and numpy Python packages
d 
d Author: Kenneth Elpus
d Support: provided as is with no support offered
d
d Distribution date: 13 May 2026
d
